{
  "$comment": [
    "Deterministic replay corpus for the webhook matching path (issue #495).",
    "Expectations are written by hand from the domain rules, never snapshotted",
    "from the engine: reference 60 exact / 30 near, amount 20 exact / 10 within",
    "1%, payer account 10, payer name 5, timing 5 (30 days). Auto-match needs",
    "top >= 90, amount <= remaining, and a lead of >= 10 over the runner-up;",
    "60-89 goes to the Exception Queue; below 60 is UNMATCHED.",
    "",
    "All transfers are dated 2026-03-10 10:00:00 (+07) so every score is a",
    "fixed number. Cases share one organization and rely on each other only",
    "through the org-wide scan: a receivable from another case can score at",
    "most 20 (amount only), because reference needs this case's invoice",
    "number, and payer/timing are gated on a linked customer. So a foreign",
    "row can never cross the 60 threshold or the 90 auto-match bar.",
    "",
    "expect.candidates lists only this case's own receivables, ordered by",
    "totalScore descending; equal scores are asserted as a set, because",
    "scoreCandidates sorts on totalScore alone and has no tie-break."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "exact reference resolves the customer and auto-matches",
      "given": {
        "customers": [{ "key": "c1", "name": "Cong Ty Minh An" }],
        "invoices": [
          {
            "key": "i1",
            "customerKey": "c1",
            "invoiceNumber": "HD-2026-0001",
            "totalAmount": 5000000
          }
        ],
        "receivables": [
          {
            "key": "r1",
            "customerKey": "c1",
            "invoiceKey": "i1",
            "originalAmount": 5000000,
            "dueDate": "2026-03-01"
          }
        ]
      },
      "webhook": {
        "providerTransactionId": "REPLAY-0001",
        "amount": 5000000,
        "counterAccountNumber": "9999888877",
        "counterAccountName": "CONG TY MINH AN",
        "description": "TT HD 2026 0001"
      },
      "expect": {
        "finalStatus": "MATCHED",
        "candidates": [{ "key": "r1", "totalScore": 90 }],
        "persistedCandidateKeys": []
      }
    },
